---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="About" description="The story behind Aavisutram.">
  <section class="section container" style="max-width: 760px;">
    <h1 class="section-title">About Aavisutram</h1>
    <!-- TODO: replace this placeholder text with her actual story -->
    <p>
      Aavisutram began as a way of carrying forward a skill passed down from a grandmother —
      knitting and crochet, learned first at home and then sharpened over years of practice,
      patterns, and a fair amount of trial and error with online tutorials.
    </p>
    <p>
      What started as making pieces for family slowly grew into something more, as friends and
      then their friends began asking for their own. Every piece here is still made by hand,
      one stitch at a time, with the same care as the very first ones.
    </p>
    <p>
      Each finished piece carries Aavisutram's own label — a small mark of the care that goes
      into it before it reaches you.
    </p>
  </section>
</Layout>
